(3013167, 423985, 62357, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little out of focus and the highlights are blown.  You can also see the reflection where you used the flash which ihs distracting.  A tighter crop of the main subject would have hidden the flash flare.</td>', 'Seems to be a little out of focus and the highlights are blown.  You can also see the reflection where you used the flash which ihs distracting.  A tighter crop of the main subject would have hidden the flash flare.', '2006-11-08 07:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013171, 424105, 62357, '<td valign="top">I like to see Neon signs in black and white - i almost did it myself, but figured that this is DPC, they will want to see them in colour.  In black and white the blown out highlights are not so prominent.  I do like this image, alhgouth I think I would have cropped it a litt different.  The cars are very distracting especially the one on the left hand corner.  I think a portrait crop of the main sign would have made this picture stand out more.</td>', 'I like to see Neon signs in black and white - i almost did it myself, but figured that this is DPC, they will want to see them in colour.  In black and white the blown out highlights are not so prominent.  I do like this image, alhgouth I think I would have cropped it a litt different.  The cars are very distracting especially the one on the left hand corner.  I think a portrait crop of the main sign would have made this picture stand out more.', '2006-11-08 07:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013177, 423312, 62357, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is just too busy.</td>', 'I think this picture is just too busy.', '2006-11-08 07:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
