(3013401, 424027, 67671, '<td valign="top">this is a good sharp shot, the only distraction is the building in the bottom left, I don''t no if it would have been possible to take the shot from a lower position, looking a little higher up the tower, and loosing the building on the left, it just looks modern, and out of place, still a very good shot.</td>', 'this is a good sharp shot, the only distraction is the building in the bottom left, I don''t no if it would have been possible to take the shot from a lower position, looking a little higher up the tower, and loosing the building on the left, it just looks modern, and out of place, still a very good shot.', '2006-11-08 08:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013419, 423819, 67671, '<td valign="top">looks like somthing at a fun fair, the neon is sharp, and well framed, the background being a little hasey, kinda brings it out, well done</td>', 'looks like somthing at a fun fair, the neon is sharp, and well framed, the background being a little hasey, kinda brings it out, well done', '2006-11-08 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
