(3014807, 423323, 67671, '<td valign="top">nice lines, well framed, black background, with no distractions, great shot.</td>', 'nice lines, well framed, black background, with no distractions, great shot.', '2006-11-08 14:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014835, 421824, 57202, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite of the challenge!  In fact, I''m adding it to my favorites. :)  I think this is one of the first macro shots of neon tubing I''ve ever seen.  Not only is it incredibly original, but it is PERFECTLY done.  The amount of exposure is dead-on.  And the composition is perfect to boot!<br/> <br/>I only have one VERY small criticism - and that''s that the red portion of the border is varying in widths.  That occurs when you increase the canvas size by an odd number.  I''ve run into that before, and get around it by always increasing in increments of even numbers.  For example, I usually just resize the image to 628, extend canvas height and width (in foreground color) by 4 pixels, then extend canvas by 8 pixels (in black).  That always ensures that border lines are the same width.  I know, I know - very nit-picky.  Just thought I''d throw in my $.02 though. ;)  Yet again, AWESOME shot! :D</td>', 'My absolute favorite of the challenge!  In fact, I''m adding it to my favorites. :)  I think this is one of the first macro shots of neon tubing I''ve ever seen.  Not only is it incredibly original, but it is PERFECTLY done.  The amount of exposure is dead-on.  And the composition is perfect to boot! I only have one VERY small criticism - and that''s that the red portion of the border is varying in widths.  That occurs when you increase the canvas size by an odd number.  I''ve run into that before, and get around it by always increasing in increments of even numbers.  For example, I usually just resize the image to 628, extend canvas height and width (in foreground color) by 4 pixels, then extend canvas by 8 pixels (in black).  That always ensures that border lines are the same width.  I know, I know - very nit-picky.  Just thought I''d throw in my $.02 though. ;)  Yet again, AWESOME shot! :D', '2006-11-08 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014845, 424372, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and perfect title!  The composition works very well for the shot and I think the subtle border helps to finish it off.  Good capture. :)</td>', 'Excellent lighting and perfect title!  The composition works very well for the shot and I think the subtle border helps to finish it off.  Good capture. :)', '2006-11-08 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014863, 424027, 57202, '<td valign="top">VERY well done shot and excellent perspective. :)  In an insanely crowded town, you actually managed to capture and simple and uncluttered shot - great work!  The composition is great and the balance between the cool blue neon and warm incandescent light is AWESOME. :D</td>', 'VERY well done shot and excellent perspective. :)  In an insanely crowded town, you actually managed to capture and simple and uncluttered shot - great work!  The composition is great and the balance between the cool blue neon and warm incandescent light is AWESOME. :D', '2006-11-08 14:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014918, 422965, 57202, '<td valign="top">While it was a little risky to go with an entry with no neon-ish colors in it, I think it really paid off!  The lighting in this shot is awesome. :)  The composition is perfect, and I love how the light plays off the metal rings of the bar stools.  This shot was a breath of fresh air after scrolling through so many random bar sign shots... ;)</td>', 'While it was a little risky to go with an entry with no neon-ish colors in it, I think it really paid off!  The lighting in this shot is awesome. :)  The composition is perfect, and I love how the light plays off the metal rings of the bar stools.  This shot was a breath of fresh air after scrolling through so many random bar sign shots... ;)', '2006-11-08 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014957, 424161, 65498, '<td valign="top">nice one.. could have gone for the other challenge too!!</td>', 'nice one.. could have gone for the other challenge too!!', '2006-11-08 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014958, 424449, 57202, '<td valign="top">GREAT perspective!!!  Not only is the neon exposed just right, but I think the lights in the windows of the surrounding buildings really adds to the shot. :)</td>', 'GREAT perspective!!!  Not only is the neon exposed just right, but I think the lights in the windows of the surrounding buildings really adds to the shot. :)', '2006-11-08 15:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014961, 422174, 65498, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot!!</td>', 'wonderful shot!!', '2006-11-08 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014965, 424464, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective and great framing of the shot.  What really makes it stand out to me is the glow behind the building (moon?). :)</td>', 'Excellent perspective and great framing of the shot.  What really makes it stand out to me is the glow behind the building (moon?). :)', '2006-11-08 15:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014975, 424161, 57202, '<td valign="top">YAY star filters! ;)  Very well done.  The green lines of light reflected off the water look awesome.  The differences between the star-pattern light beams and the way they''ve reflected off the water is too cool!  Also like the white border, but personally would have gone with a slightly thinner one.  Great photo!</td>', 'YAY star filters! ;)  Very well done.  The green lines of light reflected off the water look awesome.  The differences between the star-pattern light beams and the way they''ve reflected off the water is too cool!  Also like the white border, but personally would have gone with a slightly thinner one.  Great photo!', '2006-11-08 15:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014980, 423312, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a good B&amp;W shot, nice tonal range.  The many leading lines make it visually interesting - great composition.</td>', 'This is a good B&W shot, nice tonal range.  The many leading lines make it visually interesting - great composition.', '2006-11-08 15:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014981, 424154, 57202, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing. :)  I love how you''ve included the silhouette of the palm tree in the top-left corner.  It''s also really nice that you shot this while there was still some light in the sky - it really helps the neon stand out. :D</td>', 'Excellent framing. :)  I love how you''ve included the silhouette of the palm tree in the top-left corner.  It''s also really nice that you shot this while there was still some light in the sky - it really helps the neon stand out. :D', '2006-11-08 15:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3014987, 422174, 57202, '<td valign="top">I think that wet stone roads are an absolute gift to photographers. :)  The lights reflecting off the road here looks awesome!  Your low angle worked perfect for this shot.  Too cool that you captured some moonlight glow in the sky as well. :)</td>', 'I think that wet stone roads are an absolute gift to photographers. :)  The lights reflecting off the road here looks awesome!  Your low angle worked perfect for this shot.  Too cool that you captured some moonlight glow in the sky as well. :)', '2006-11-08 15:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3015001, 424040, 57202, '<td valign="top">Wow, I never thought that I''d see such a well-done shot of a fast food joint. :)  The lighting is awesome, the composition is great, and the neon is perfectly exposed.  Not only did you take the time to make sure the painted lines of the No Parking area were parallel with the bottom of the frame, but you also framed this so that the right-side line of the handicapped spot leads you into the shot from the bottom-right corner.  Excellent use of the subtle border as well.  Hopefully everyone else will be able to see past the fast food joint and recognize how great a shot this is. :)</td>', 'Wow, I never thought that I''d see such a well-done shot of a fast food joint. :)  The lighting is awesome, the composition is great, and the neon is perfectly exposed.  Not only did you take the time to make sure the painted lines of the No Parking area were parallel with the bottom of the frame, but you also framed this so that the right-side line of the handicapped spot leads you into the shot from the bottom-right corner.  Excellent use of the subtle border as well.  Hopefully everyone else will be able to see past the fast food joint and recognize how great a shot this is. :)', '2006-11-08 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3015006, 424032, 57202, '<td valign="top">While there were several B &amp; W renditions of neon in this challenge, this is by far the best one. :D  The abstract feel to the shot and extremely shallow DOF work SO great here!  Wonderful composition, good border choice, and overall awesome shot!</td>', 'While there were several B & W renditions of neon in this challenge, this is by far the best one. :D  The abstract feel to the shot and extremely shallow DOF work SO great here!  Wonderful composition, good border choice, and overall awesome shot!', '2006-11-08 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3015036, 423922, 57202, '<td valign="top">While I think that some voters may hammer this shot for "being too dark", I think this totally rocks!  The ethereal glow cast on the garage door and booth is great. :)  The exposure on the neon couldn''t be better and you seem to have handled the white balance choice quite well, as the fluorescent tubing looks great here.  The only thing I may have done differently would have been to use a rectangular crop instead of a square one.  Great shot! :D</td>', 'While I think that some voters may hammer this shot for "being too dark", I think this totally rocks!  The ethereal glow cast on the garage door and booth is great. :)  The exposure on the neon couldn''t be better and you seem to have handled the white balance choice quite well, as the fluorescent tubing looks great here.  The only thing I may have done differently would have been to use a rectangular crop instead of a square one.  Great shot! :D', '2006-11-08 15:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3015055, 422679, 57202, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect composition!  You obviously chose this framing quite meticulously, and it paid off.  The exposure on the neon is great and I like the faint warm glow on the building in the background. :)</td>', 'Absolutely perfect composition!  You obviously chose this framing quite meticulously, and it paid off.  The exposure on the neon is great and I like the faint warm glow on the building in the background. :)', '2006-11-08 15:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
