(3015308, 423991, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo. What the sign actually says doesn''t seem to fit though. Not that you can control that, heh. It looks like a place that has been there awhile, so to people in your city it probably rings some nostalgia. In that sense I think it works. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure many people are going to put as much thought into this, but I''m glad I did.<br/> <br/>To nit-pick: Your upper right street light looks to have suffered a bit from the editting.</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo. What the sign actually says doesn''t seem to fit though. Not that you can control that, heh. It looks like a place that has been there awhile, so to people in your city it probably rings some nostalgia. In that sense I think it works.  I''m not sure many people are going to put as much thought into this, but I''m glad I did. To nit-pick: Your upper right street light looks to have suffered a bit from the editting.', '2006-11-08 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
