(3030450, 423991, 32767, '<td valign="top">This image had great potential. I try not to harp on tilts, sharpness, noise, blown highlights and all that other junk but this image would have been truly great if the technicals were at least a little stronger. This shot was a tough one to nail. The neon is overexposed and the dudes who really highlight the scene are a dash under. I''d bet, two seconds earlier that passing cars headlights would have lit those guys up beautifully. Good Luck!</td>', 'This image had great potential. I try not to harp on tilts, sharpness, noise, blown highlights and all that other junk but this image would have been truly great if the technicals were at least a little stronger. This shot was a tough one to nail. The neon is overexposed and the dudes who really highlight the scene are a dash under. I''d bet, two seconds earlier that passing cars headlights would have lit those guys up beautifully. Good Luck!', '2006-11-14 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
