(3032626, 423986, 10867, '<td valign="top">Yes, it was kind of strange that we both shot this.  I knew as soon as I decided to try this challenge, though (and I don''t try very many) that the Zanzibar''s was one of the neon signs I wanted to shoot, simply because, despite its sleazy subject, it had the most "neon art" of any I could think of in our city.  (I eventually did find a couple of other signs that were more or less interesting, but only more or less.) I took about 30 shots , trying to get one in which all the sections of the sign were lit up at the same time.  The one I used was the only usable one of the 30 or so in which at least most of them were. <br/> <br/>Interestingly, you chose to emphasize the sleaze element by showing a rather sleazy looking person outside the building (a very nice touch, I think) and including all the text at the bottom of the sign.  I guess I was a bit embarrassed about the sleaze, and so "censored" the bottom of the sign.</td>', 'Yes, it was kind of strange that we both shot this.  I knew as soon as I decided to try this challenge, though (and I don''t try very many) that the Zanzibar''s was one of the neon signs I wanted to shoot, simply because, despite its sleazy subject, it had the most "neon art" of any I could think of in our city.  (I eventually did find a couple of other signs that were more or less interesting, but only more or less.) I took about 30 shots , trying to get one in which all the sections of the sign were lit up at the same time.  The one I used was the only usable one of the 30 or so in which at least most of them were.  Interestingly, you chose to emphasize the sleaze element by showing a rather sleazy looking person outside the building (a very nice touch, I think) and including all the text at the bottom of the sign.  I guess I was a bit embarrassed about the sleaze, and so "censored" the bottom of the sign.', '2006-11-15 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3032627, 424449, 61654, '<td valign="top">I worked there for 6 years(7 months in Times Square)...Beautiful shot even though I feel as though I may puke. :)</td>', 'I worked there for 6 years(7 months in Times Square)...Beautiful shot even though I feel as though I may puke. :)', '2006-11-15 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3032634, 424215, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wild and crazy and what a little water can do! Very clever capture. Congratulations on your 7th place.</td>', 'Wild and crazy and what a little water can do! Very clever capture. Congratulations on your 7th place.', '2006-11-15 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3032640, 423539, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great use of w.a. to bring it all home. Congratulations on your 8th place.</td>', 'Great use of w.a. to bring it all home. Congratulations on your 8th place.', '2006-11-15 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3032648, 424258, 15266, '<td valign="top">Dude! You do me proud once again!  :D   I knew this was a winner the moment I saw it.  Congrats..</td>', 'Dude! You do me proud once again!  :D   I knew this was a winner the moment I saw it.  Congrats..', '2006-11-15 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
