(3032728, 422038, 31399, '<td valign="top">need I comment? we SEE my score given you during voting!!! yep, I''m one of the six 9s.  I LIKED this shot!</td>', 'need I comment? we SEE my score given you during voting!!! yep, I''m one of the six 9s.  I LIKED this shot!', '2006-11-15 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
