(3032738, 424405, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great finish - congrats!  One of the few that actually added the environment to the shot, and great perspective to include the reflection in the crosswalk stripes.</td>', 'Great finish - congrats!  One of the few that actually added the environment to the shot, and great perspective to include the reflection in the crosswalk stripes.', '2006-11-15 00:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
