(3033061, 424027, 53964, '<td valign="top">Now you can quit whining about having no ribbons ;)<br/>I do love it, though :D</td>', 'Now you can quit whining about having no ribbons ;)I do love it, though :D', '2006-11-15 02:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033105, 423991, 35545, '<td valign="top">Who says that everything has to be "tack sharp" (hate that term) and oversaturated to be good.  The muted colors and "blown" highlights make this look like a picture from when Colfax was in its heyday.  It''s a great capture.<br/> <br/>Thanks, also, for the notes.  I''m not from Denver, but I have a greater sense of the place after reading them.</td>', 'Who says that everything has to be "tack sharp" (hate that term) and oversaturated to be good.  The muted colors and "blown" highlights make this look like a picture from when Colfax was in its heyday.  It''s a great capture. Thanks, also, for the notes.  I''m not from Denver, but I have a greater sense of the place after reading them.', '2006-11-15 03:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033129, 424027, 57202, '<td valign="top">I knew this one would ribbon! :D  Still one of the most uncluttered Vegas shots I think I''ve ever seen.  Great job!</td>', 'I knew this one would ribbon! :D  Still one of the most uncluttered Vegas shots I think I''ve ever seen.  Great job!', '2006-11-15 03:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033130, 422321, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top20 finish and on your almost perfect prediction. Would have liked to see it ribbon with 6.89, though</td>', 'Congrats on your top20 finish and on your almost perfect prediction. Would have liked to see it ribbon with 6.89, though', '2006-11-15 03:35:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033133, 421824, 57202, '<td valign="top">Still one my favorites out of all the entries!  Amazing clarity and perfect composition. :)</td>', 'Still one my favorites out of all the entries!  Amazing clarity and perfect composition. :)', '2006-11-15 03:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
