(3033173, 424258, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats dude, I didn´t vote but judging from the top 20 thumbnails, the best shot won this challenge as far as I am concerned, good creativity, very much in spirit of Scalvert´s shots.</td>', 'Congrats dude, I didn´t vote but judging from the top 20 thumbnails, the best shot won this challenge as far as I am concerned, good creativity, very much in spirit of Scalvert´s shots.', '2006-11-15 04:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
