(3033201, 423991, 62812, '<td valign="top">The two pictures i pick out as the best two finish 107th and 106th. Art isnt for the masses! This is a great picture so dont let the masses get you down. It screams narrative and could easily pass as a Travis Bickle street vision. You are an artist not a technician. Well done on producing such a shot.</td>', 'The two pictures i pick out as the best two finish 107th and 106th. Art isnt for the masses! This is a great picture so dont let the masses get you down. It screams narrative and could easily pass as a Travis Bickle street vision. You are an artist not a technician. Well done on producing such a shot.', '2006-11-15 04:35:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033276, 421824, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deseved ribbon, Tom. One of the rare "different" shots, well composed and of great clarity. I think I''ll have to get me that G7, too.</td>', 'Congrats on your well deseved ribbon, Tom. One of the rare "different" shots, well composed and of great clarity. I think I''ll have to get me that G7, too.', '2006-11-15 05:18:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033279, 424097, 40430, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes! The other Pike''s Market image was probably taken in the afternoon, so 12 hours and 5 minutes apart because there was no retail business going on at 10 until 5AM.   <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-15 05:23:25.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the votes! The other Pike''s Market image was probably taken in the afternoon, so 12 hours and 5 minutes apart because there was no retail business going on at 10 until 5AM.   ', '2006-11-15 05:20:35.000000', '2006-11-15 05:23:25.000000', 0),
