(3033323, 424027, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great job... I love how the ''restaurant'' neon sign in the background isn''t lit up.  That would have been a major distraction to the shot.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great job... I love how the ''restaurant'' neon sign in the background isn''t lit up.  That would have been a major distraction to the shot.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-15 06:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
