(3033435, 424406, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 8''s in this challenge.  Met the challenge but added context instead of just being a picture of something neon.  On top of that, I like the composition, and I love the lighting on the face - really a good picture!</td>', 'This was one of my 8''s in this challenge.  Met the challenge but added context instead of just being a picture of something neon.  On top of that, I like the composition, and I love the lighting on the face - really a good picture!', '2006-11-15 07:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033441, 423191, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is interesting to me on a number of levels - for one, what the heck is PSFS?  Makes no sense, unless you live in Philly, I guess.  Second, I like the architecture, and third, what''s the purple in the middle windows?  Sky reflection?  Whatever it is, it''s cool!</td>', 'This is interesting to me on a number of levels - for one, what the heck is PSFS?  Makes no sense, unless you live in Philly, I guess.  Second, I like the architecture, and third, what''s the purple in the middle windows?  Sky reflection?  Whatever it is, it''s cool!', '2006-11-15 07:26:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033448, 421631, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this was nicely unique!  Not just another head-on neon image.  The reflection is cool, too - triple even.  Quite a nice shot - have fun with the new toy!  (And though the score says otherwise, this doesn''t suck at all.)  And add to that my congrats on a new personal best!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-15 07:30:55.</i></td>', 'I thought this was nicely unique!  Not just another head-on neon image.  The reflection is cool, too - triple even.  Quite a nice shot - have fun with the new toy!  (And though the score says otherwise, this doesn''t suck at all.)  And add to that my congrats on a new personal best!', '2006-11-15 07:29:03.000000', '2006-11-15 07:30:55.000000', 0),
(3033452, 421748, 30982, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 - very crisp and clear, excellent job with exposure.  So far it seems this is the highest placed/scored neon amongst Team Suck, so you can add that honor!</td>', 'I gave this a 6 - very crisp and clear, excellent job with exposure.  So far it seems this is the highest placed/scored neon amongst Team Suck, so you can add that honor!', '2006-11-15 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
