(3033637, 423291, 49007, '<td valign="top">I''m quite astounded that people didn''t care for the slight motion in the image. This is exactly why I picked this image. I wanted to have visual interest in the image that no other image would have. I didn''t have the usual long lines of people or the large group of motorcycles. On this particular Sunday evening I only had traffic.<br/> <br/>Ever since I read <a href="//strobist.blogspot.com/2006/06/general-theory-strive-for-layers-of.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This</a> Strobist article, I''ve been trying to incorporate Layers of Interest.<br/> <br/>I''ll remember next time that DPC voters only care about the actual challenge description.</td>', 'I''m quite astounded that people didn''t care for the slight motion in the image. This is exactly why I picked this image. I wanted to have visual interest in the image that no other image would have. I didn''t have the usual long lines of people or the large group of motorcycles. On this particular Sunday evening I only had traffic. Ever since I read This Strobist article, I''ve been trying to incorporate Layers of Interest. I''ll remember next time that DPC voters only care about the actual challenge description.', '2006-11-15 09:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3033638, 424406, 66597, '<td valign="top">Xianart,<br/>I found this to be one of the most creative entries in the challenge. I would like to see it with just a tad more light on the guy, especially on fingers. I think the simplicity of the sign works well with the model.</td>', 'Xianart,I found this to be one of the most creative entries in the challenge. I would like to see it with just a tad more light on the guy, especially on fingers. I think the simplicity of the sign works well with the model.', '2006-11-15 09:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
