(3033695, 424182, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really loved this one!   I love the interest you added by using that angle!   It''s hard to make a photo of a sign interesting, but I think you really pulled it off.   I really think this photo deserves a much higher score than it got!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really loved this one!   I love the interest you added by using that angle!   It''s hard to make a photo of a sign interesting, but I think you really pulled it off.   I really think this photo deserves a much higher score than it got! ', '2006-11-15 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
