(3035011, 423728, 45475, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by msdoubletrouble:</b></div><hr/><i> wow..there IS a bulb out! cool touch.  you do the B/W conversion on this in ''channels'' or ''conversions''? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Sonya. Actually, there was hardly any colour to begin with, the neon was white anyway. I converted to b&amp;w using the Channel Mixer (monochrome) just to tidy it up the ugly yellow cast around the Menopause poster. Cheers!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by msdoubletrouble: wow..there IS a bulb out! cool touch.  you do the B/W conversion on this in ''channels'' or ''conversions''?   Thanks Sonya. Actually, there was hardly any colour to begin with, the neon was white anyway. I converted to b&w using the Channel Mixer (monochrome) just to tidy it up the ugly yellow cast around the Menopause poster. Cheers! ', '2006-11-15 16:19:11.000000', NULL, 0),
