(3036495, 424452, 22537, '<td valign="top">Firstly, BOB is good!  Now that we got that out of the way, its  not YOUR shot.  What I mean by this is that there certainly is a neon object but so what? The neon serves only as a frame and you are relying too much upon someone else''s "art" to add value to your image.  I like the crop as it is bold and concise but otherwise, what is yours?? You asked .. you got and BTW welcome to the 40s.</td>', 'Firstly, BOB is good!  Now that we got that out of the way, its  not YOUR shot.  What I mean by this is that there certainly is a neon object but so what? The neon serves only as a frame and you are relying too much upon someone else''s "art" to add value to your image.  I like the crop as it is bold and concise but otherwise, what is yours?? You asked .. you got and BTW welcome to the 40s.', '2006-11-16 01:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3036546, 424452, 48228, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t able to vote for this one Sherryll, due to being away, but I would have given you a "6" or a "7", re some of the entries were really top stuff. <br/>I feel you did not deserve the 1''s 2''s &amp; 3''s, that you received, and don''t know why you got no comments. <br/>I really like your composition, and now that I have read your own comments, I like the fact that you didn''t have to put a border around it due to the image that you took was already framed. <br/>Well done girl, and keep trying, as we all learn something each and every time we take a photo.</td>', 'I wasn''t able to vote for this one Sherryll, due to being away, but I would have given you a "6" or a "7", re some of the entries were really top stuff. I feel you did not deserve the 1''s 2''s & 3''s, that you received, and don''t know why you got no comments. I really like your composition, and now that I have read your own comments, I like the fact that you didn''t have to put a border around it due to the image that you took was already framed. Well done girl, and keep trying, as we all learn something each and every time we take a photo.', '2006-11-16 01:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
