(3038152, 424452, 67258, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 3 for this, although it was a very close run thing to a 4 - don''t be too disheartened though, because I did vote consistently lower than my average throughout this challenge.  Ivo has pretty much summed up my feelings - you have competently photographed someone elses artwork, but haven''t brought anything of yourself to it.  I note that you say you had originally wanted to photograph the series of three panels, but that someone was sat in front of one of them - I wonder whether there might have been a photo opportunity in that.  Hope this explains one of your votes.</td>', 'I gave you a 3 for this, although it was a very close run thing to a 4 - don''t be too disheartened though, because I did vote consistently lower than my average throughout this challenge.  Ivo has pretty much summed up my feelings - you have competently photographed someone elses artwork, but haven''t brought anything of yourself to it.  I note that you say you had originally wanted to photograph the series of three panels, but that someone was sat in front of one of them - I wonder whether there might have been a photo opportunity in that.  Hope this explains one of your votes.', '2006-11-16 14:46:08.000000', NULL, 0),
