(3071786, 422940, 5112, '<td valign="top">He, he, I''m flattered to think that we might have been thinking along the same lines.  My entry would have been this:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=423260" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/578/thumb/423260.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/578/thumb/423260.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/578/thumb/423260.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>But I decided to enter it to long exposure instead (because I was pandering to high voters with my entry to reflections without mirrors II).<br/> <br/>Funny stuff.<br/> <br/>You rotated the lens, I moved the camera.  Different effect, somewhat similar in feel.</td>', 'He, he, I''m flattered to think that we might have been thinking along the same lines.  My entry would have been this:   But I decided to enter it to long exposure instead (because I was pandering to high voters with my entry to reflections without mirrors II). Funny stuff. You rotated the lens, I moved the camera.  Different effect, somewhat similar in feel.', '2006-11-29 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3072860, 422940, 656, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ursula:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>But I decided to enter it to long exposure instead (because I was pandering to high voters with my entry to reflections without mirrors II).<br/> <br/>Funny stuff.<br/> <br/>You rotated the lens, I moved the camera.  Different effect, somewhat similar in feel. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Going by scores, I think you made the right choice ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by ursula: But I decided to enter it to long exposure instead (because I was pandering to high voters with my entry to reflections without mirrors II). Funny stuff. You rotated the lens, I moved the camera.  Different effect, somewhat similar in feel.   Going by scores, I think you made the right choice ;)', '2006-11-29 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
